# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Google Sign-In (Google Identity Services)
# ─────────────────────────────────────────────────────────────
# Must be EXACTLY the same value as GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID in backend/.env
#
# 1. Go to https://console.cloud.google.com/apis/credentials
# 2. Create an OAuth 2.0 Client ID → type "Web application"
# 3. Under "Authorized JavaScript origins" add BOTH:
#      http://localhost:3000
#      https://your-app.vercel.app
# 4. Paste the Client ID below, then restart `npm run dev`.
#
# Vite only exposes variables prefixed with VITE_ to the browser.
VITE_GOOGLE_CLIENT_ID=

# Note: the old GEMINI_API_KEY / APP_URL entries from the AI Studio
# template are unused by this app and have been removed.